853
00:44:37.542 --> 00:44:40.145
will be deemed acts
of God and explicitly

854
00:44:40.178 --> 00:44:41.880
not covered under said policy."

855
00:44:41.913 --> 00:44:42.781
>>Thank you.

856
00:44:42.814 --> 00:44:44.115
And would you please
